# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps the host
# node_modules out of the image. Without this the COPY of the frontend sources
# would overwrite the node_modules that npm ci just installed.
# BuildKit reads this file because it is named after the Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.svelte-kit
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.iml
**/__screenshots__
g01-documentation
devops-stack
